WEBVTT

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.263
and disappear.

00:01:00.297 --> 00:01:01.963
They minimize.

00:01:01.963 --> 00:01:04.697
They often blame other people.

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:08.663
But what they don't do, typically,
is try to make things better.

00:01:09.663 --> 00:01:13.163
When people feel guilt
about a specific behavior --

00:01:13.163 --> 00:01:16.230
"I feel bad that I did that" --

00:01:16.263 --> 00:01:19.897
they're focused on the behavior
and the effects on other people,

00:01:19.897 --> 00:01:24.297
and that seems to push people
in a much more constructive direction.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:29.697
People who feel guilt about a behavior
without feeling shame about the self

00:01:29.697 --> 00:01:34.597
are more inclined to confess, apologize,